{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Soggy Beans is a relaxing side-idler where fish visit you. Think bird watching, but with fish. Decorate, take pictures, complete photography quests, or just let your friends keep you company while you do other things.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2636430/extras/Fish.gif?t=1749340806\" /></div>Soggy Beans was made from a desire to have a low intensity game to enjoy on the side of other things, instead of watching videos or scrolling.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Play as much or as little as you like</strong>: let it run while you check your emails, during meetings, or even while playing other games.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2636430/extras/Header_Spot.gif?t=1749340806\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2636430/extras/Discover.gif?t=1749340806\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Find fish of all shapes and sizes.</strong> Fish come and go as they please, spot new ones as they visit and record each sighting in your journal.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2636430/extras/Header_Journal.gif?t=1749340806\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2636430/extras/Journal.gif?t=1749340806\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Keep track of all the fish</strong> you see, update their profiles, and watch as your journal grows.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2636430/extras/Header_Pics.gif?t=1749340806\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2636430/extras/Camera.gif?t=1749340806\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Capture photos of fish</strong> to save the memory forever. Set them as profile pictures in your journal, or use them as stickers in your scrapbook.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2636430/extras/Header_Beans.gif?t=1749340806\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2636430/extras/Beans.gif?t=1749340806\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Collect beans</strong> that fish knock loose. Watch them push the bean machine - sometimes they drop them, sometimes they don\u2019t (but mostly they do!).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2636430/extras/Header_Decorate_V2.gif?t=1749340806\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2636430/extras/Decorate.gif?t=1749340806\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Create your own little corner of the ocean</strong> with a variety of furniture pieces. You can stack things, create blueprints, and change backgrounds.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2636430/extras/Mood.png?t=1749340806\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Each piece of furniture adds its own touch</strong>, shaping the mood of your seascape and helping attract certain fish.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2636430/extras/Header_Relax.gif?t=1749340806\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2636430/extras/Relax.png?t=1749340806\" /></div></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2636430?t=1749340806","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2636430/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1749340806","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2636430/d795869cc1759735c7b4eedb9435432e0a551fdd/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1749340806","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2636430/d795869cc1759735c7b4eedb9435432e0a551fdd/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1749340806","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":3461030,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Soggy Beans is a relaxing side-idler where fish visit you. Think bird watching, but with fish. Decorate, take pictures, complete photography quests, or just let your friends keep you company while you do other things.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2636430/extras/Fish.gif?t=1749340806\